#: ../../source/docs/common-crsf-telemetry.rst:5
#: 3ad01536f1a84008a634fb7ea6e6ccd1 4f202c0a917b4be983777d88685a9ed8
#: 6702753314794e43b6a2efec9f6956c4 b5c1e89aa2a044a682e5ab2d73474252
#: c7726b75f9334aeca48c943383721af9 ebc0fec537ce43889c110193b618cde6
msgid "TBS Crossfire Telemetry"
msgstr "TBS Crossfire 数传"

#: ../../source/docs/common-crsf-telemetry.rst:7
#: 5148ba78e1bb40c5aebe6dd720db1b43 550f2818659347339fd0efbc7f7079b9
#: 67e759f9818e47b3ba2e4c6e4492995e b1934bb2d9bc4c67a92ec3790213f8ad
#: e6efa2b7d3214f9fb981d4cc763026a0 f7a6cb6ee0014fc7bf35784832411fe3
msgid ""
"ELRS (ExpressLRS) RC systems use the CRSF protocol and are connected in a "
"similar manner. ELRS receivers can also be used in Mavlink mode to provide "
"both bidirectional Mavlink telemetry and RC control over a single TX-RX "
"pair. Details `here <https://www.expresslrs.org/software/mavlink/>`_."
msgstr ""
"ELRS（ExpressLRS）遥控系统使用 CRSF 协议，连接方式类似。ELRS 接收机也可以在 Mavlink 模式下使用，通过单对 TX-RX "
"提供双向 Mavlink 数传和遥控控制。详情请见 `此处 "
"<https://www.expresslrs.org/software/mavlink/>`_。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-crsf-telemetry.rst:9
#: 2a052207909745c683b4eeb452dfc631 2b410ae01794435aaf85353139557779
#: 54cd84995c01463f81bb774c3737158a 92be0396f0e644d9a50f916b34207d53
#: a68a5dde76a442f284ad10f4c9b89fa8 c76193020094477d8b54a2e8fcf5fcef
msgid ""
"TBS Crossfire Receivers incorporate telemetry along with RC control "
"information in their interface to ArduPilot. ArduPilot supports native CRSF "
"telemetry and extensions to it that allow using the :Ref:`common-frsky-"
"yaapu`. See :ref:`common-tbs-rc` for connection and setup information."
msgstr ""
"TBS Crossfire 接收机在其与 ArduPilot 的接口中集成了数传和遥控控制信息。ArduPilot 支持原生 CRSF "
"数传及其扩展，允许使用 :Ref:`common-frsky-yaapu`。有关连接和设置信息，请参阅 :ref:`common-tbs-rc`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-crsf-telemetry.rst:11
#: 1fec0b6c8e504b51a54f57e1381cebef 3bccc4b425654650a506916d57d42a11
#: 4bcfe50149a74842911dd40700968c1c 829754874afe4600a9406396b8b7ef85
#: 8b765abd2520446bba7d08e067b87e9a b2a429c16b3d4adf9f2c7c799740aec9
msgid ""
"OpenTx will discover the native CRSF Telemetry sensors (but a limited "
"number, use passthru option below for more displayed information using Yaapu"
" Telemetry script), which then can be displayed on `OpenTX "
"<https://www.open-tx.org/>`_ telemetry screens or repeated from the CRSF TX "
"module's WIFI to MAVLink Ground Control Stations:"
msgstr ""
"OpenTx 将发现原生 CRSF 数传传感器（但数量有限，使用下面的直通选项可通过 Yaapu 数传脚本显示更多信息），然后可以在 `OpenTX "
"<https://www.open-tx.org/>`_ 数传屏幕上显示，或从 CRSF TX 模块的 WIFI 中继到 MAVLink 地面控制站："

#: ../../source/docs/common-crsf-telemetry.rst:15
#: 1e5cf2ee6aac423fa6af2359dc695ecf 5c6b61b7cbfd434081188e4e0cbc042c
#: 7b0ad5f7bc334df999ad316866bc8f49 9fe0227700c34b3fb197a87abcc73d39
#: bd9d908d3f4e46c7829e7365ddb8c895 ffcdc47170504b6b91e0528272f70bf0
msgid "These values can be displayed on OpenTX transmitters in several ways:"
msgstr "这些值可以通过多种方式在 OpenTX 发射机上显示："

#: ../../source/docs/common-crsf-telemetry.rst:17
#: 5ec19068921b44819f8068a893e25d52 82064afd9eb348a2b78ef908c224038c
#: cc114243c9bd42a2998fb2f2f2360255 d88599dfe9e840e1b13397db2184ce79
#: e2af62add2e64f99918f8167fcabada3 f96606d10e8248eb9012db0113dbe85f
msgid "Using the built-in telemetry screens:"
msgstr "使用内置数传屏幕："

#: ../../source/docs/common-crsf-telemetry.rst:21
#: 04f16c037ffe465fba26e9b82998460f 75b446a00c774c70835a84836e6d83d5
#: a69fe8fced4142a8ae8ca3877cf5f9de f2737e2548ee45c79bb1a8ffe80b17df
#: fb676bc4bd384d73b294ef3b90b04dea fb75a2efe6b8472abbaede673ace037a
msgid ""
"In addition, by setting :ref:`RC_OPTIONS<RC_OPTIONS>` bit 8, additional "
"ArduPilot telemetry items are transferred which allows use of the "
":ref:`common-frsky-yaapu` on OpenTX transmitters. Limitations and additional"
" information is shown `here <https://discuss.ardupilot.org/t/passthrough-"
"telemetry-over-crsf-crossfire>`__."
msgstr ""
"此外，通过设置 :ref:`RC_OPTIONS<RC_OPTIONS>` 第 8 位，可以传输额外的 ArduPilot 数传项目，允许在 "
"OpenTX 发射机上使用 :ref:`common-frsky-yaapu`。限制和额外信息请见 `此处 "
"<https://discuss.ardupilot.org/t/passthrough-telemetry-over-crsf-"
"crossfire>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-crsf-telemetry.rst:26
#: 0193c53a52134211833f287a91f04661 423ab274202544e4ab93ec646b77e614
#: adb1c1c0df6f47a2b28035a7bc67322b cb3a04966a1c4525bc19e2cf97bbf6e3
#: cc201c0ef20f403baf62e300a1a07b08 fc0b813415cb4a549f85ae4413f7348e
msgid ""
"when using :ref:`RC_OPTIONS<RC_OPTIONS>` bit 8 for passthru, be sure no "
"SERIAL port is setup to use ``SERIALx_PROTOCOL`` = 10 (Passthrough) to avoid"
" a conflict and unreliable operation."
msgstr ""
"使用 :ref:`RC_OPTIONS<RC_OPTIONS>` 第 8 位进行直通时，请确保没有 SERIAL 端口设置为使用 "
"``SERIALx_PROTOCOL`` = 10（直通），以避免冲突和不稳定操作。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-crsf-telemetry.rst:28
#: 5373749f9f5f4da2ae0c6d85b0bf8d2d 6b79ecc09fee42ceb15bb0decf925c14
#: b291ddc746be49d88d091c94d95aafc1 b5853adedbae4ef383b6ff67fd19ad71
#: d669be2ed695410289a8f99669c4e2da f3a0eba38fff4b90b70fa983ca8ec5c9
msgid ""
"Several OpenTX scripts are normally provided for adjusting CRSF TX and RX "
"system parameters. They are accessed by long pressing the SYS button."
msgstr "通常提供几个 OpenTX 脚本用于调整 CRSF TX 和 RX 系统参数。通过长按 SYS 按钮访问。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-crsf-telemetry.rst:31
#: 4465df6c12a14ee5821f58bf22d60188 79082c63235a4a7885b2762128cf4f1b
#: 869da35dbca148ce840c9713b439c95e 8da7560763f44eb0a70acfd4e6066dd5
#: bc483ad5c55042df95c1c797185373d0 f0f85216e9c240ccad0b37123c5ae5b5
msgid "ArduPilot Parameter Editor"
msgstr "ArduPilot 参数编辑器"

#: ../../source/docs/common-crsf-telemetry.rst:33
#: 0273428d476747ef9fbb736d1202649d 4b5609ce86784080953390dbd8106a55
#: 6f85f95986244c0b89a566e99376c647 74d4145500704138afd8704d1a3913c5
#: 90260dd123644e8ea2a48f0f91018e31 9d2be03c5de947f0914d8b82f4b05f81
msgid ""
"In  addition, the ArduPilot CRSF implementation provides for ArduPilot "
"parameter adjustment, similar in function to ArduPilot's :ref:`common-"
"paramosd` feature."
msgstr ""
"此外，ArduPilot 的 CRSF 实现提供了 ArduPilot 参数调整功能，类似于 ArduPilot 的 :ref:`common-"
"paramosd` 功能。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-crsf-telemetry.rst:35
#: 08824eb18ede4410bdd6ae53e08ca22f 5591485b97864ee6b91bda646344383e
#: 5b2d58ae27664059aeb6d56e2cd2587a b54d2542a1b14447be1b3408210e35e0
#: bcebda7aae7140158fedfab10b1c523b ece933bc222a44e9b658cd3485c00888
msgid ""
"If the autopilot has any active OSD (:ref:`OSD_TYPE<OSD_TYPE>` not equal to "
"\"0\") , this feature is automatically enabled. If not, then selecting "
":ref:`OSD_TYPE<OSD_TYPE>` = 4 (TX only) will enable it."
msgstr ""
"如果飞控有任何活动的 OSD（:ref:`OSD_TYPE<OSD_TYPE>` 不等于「0」），此功能将自动启用。如果没有，则选择 "
":ref:`OSD_TYPE<OSD_TYPE>` = 4（仅 TX）将启用它。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-crsf-telemetry.rst:37
#: 0107dcbcd9374cf7b90f32cec51d0a75 13a1f15f40a341309d31ee01a3291990
#: 1bf8d3ddf03445b2bac58b05c730e331 5c220744ee864f7b8398ebe5ce9dfd77
#: 81f0d9db5a3a4afca7dd137cb8359c45 fc196d9bc8124ff5bcecd14bef90ccda
msgid ""
"Selecting the Crossfire Configuration LUA script in the transmitter will "
"show:"
msgstr "在发射机中选择 Crossfire 配置 LUA 脚本将显示："

#: ../../source/docs/common-crsf-telemetry.rst:41
#: 1a030170addb4f69a09cd1d160d37423 1f439304987e49578937d207f96c93f8
#: 2bee439a88534aeabe3a18aeefb87a38 3031e60ed2e84697aabc626ef2a4d1ea
#: 31d176e19e1f40fa8529810a0d222359 b40a4ef095834b3b9a3c4fd5bb47f982
msgid ""
"And selecting the ArduPilot vehicle shown in that list will activate the "
":ref:`common-paramosd` with a list of all parameters which have been setup "
"for both OSD screens."
msgstr "选择列表中显示的 ArduPilot 飞行器将激活 :ref:`common-paramosd`，显示所有为 OSD 屏幕设置的参数列表。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-crsf-telemetry.rst:45
#: 17d15d06dd4b47ff926c3dd264d026bc 1dde28fa5055447e93d91ecc07c21731
#: 3718a25abc4849b5bb3a6137b71529d6 69db9bc9839a4c0993a1197fe3dba5a1
#: 90dc267b6e2f4107a60b6b262c66a0cc e848769bfb5441ff8cf92ed3be25cb6e
msgid ""
"Some autopilots will not display the parameter values that have text names, "
"as text, but rather as a number, in order to save flash space. See  "
":ref:`common-limited_firmware` for those without CRSF TEXT capability."
msgstr ""
"为节省 Flash 空间，部分飞控不会以文本形式显示具有文本名称的参数值，而是显示数字。没有 CRSF TEXT 功能的飞控请参阅 "
":ref:`common-limited_firmware`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-crsf-telemetry.rst:48
#: 104fc5a711af42d1aace6e74e673370d 1977986abb8d43bdb9dbb1f031e43d37
#: 37ce746aebeb4ea8a737a87a610ab9f7 629b1b8676f04d379b136095fac5dfa5
#: 944f3456dda24fb482fb10bb1da4e041
msgid "Scripted CRSF Menus"
msgstr "脚本化 CRSF 菜单"

#: ../../source/docs/common-crsf-telemetry.rst:50
#: 07024c0da5d04c3e9b55c7769b54df95 17412de78b5e49149efc06a98f908979
#: 552af2cd8e17482cbd503559bd13fa87 7a6a44dfd75a432f8b2214ac029447fe
#: 7f4af810e6bf4f3aba3629aec11347b1
msgid ""
"ArduPilot supports custom CRSF menus created via Lua scripts. These menus "
"appear alongside the built-in ArduPilot parameter editor in the "
"transmitter's Crossfire Configuration screen, and can be used to provide "
"task-specific configuration interfaces."
msgstr ""
"ArduPilot 支持通过 Lua 脚本创建自定义 CRSF 菜单。这些菜单与内置的 ArduPilot 参数编辑器一起显示在遥控器的 "
"Crossfire Configuration 界面中，可用于提供面向特定任务的配置界面。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-crsf-telemetry.rst:52
#: 07d90c7834184fbbb7192c380d3504d3 1063680961b24d0cbd8f9d816b4a8660
#: 6381a778ffb14c1f8cfb5cbacc1c8bd8 c116fb2e2cc04e9f86cdfd8a5cf3a5a0
#: c32626e9e7634106937326b0f5da54b3
msgid ""
"The `crsf_helper.lua module "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/libraries/AP_Scripting/examples/crsf-"
"menu.lua>`__  provides a high-level API which can be placed in LUA scripts "
"for creating CRSF menus. Multiple independent menu scripts can run "
"simultaneously — for example, a PID tuning menu and an OSD configuration "
"menu can coexist without conflicts."
msgstr ""
"`crsf_helper.lua 模块 "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/libraries/AP_Scripting/examples/crsf-"
"menu.lua>`__ 提供了一个高级 API，可放入 LUA 脚本中用于创建 CRSF 菜单。多个独立的菜单脚本可以同时运行——例如，PID "
"调参菜单和 OSD 配置菜单可以互不冲突地共存。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-crsf-telemetry.rst:54
#: 72d28c3ff4ad4eeb9e52cd7a0dd899ab 9bc8f0f67c8942af80897ba2db56804f
#: c6b2ab9fcfcb42f3aa363380cffade94 d0fa17d38d544fae993f63caf98e148d
#: fc9f6e41bfa34f53a7d352382ec985db
msgid "**Multi-menu support (4.7 and later):**"
msgstr "**多菜单支持（4.7 及更高版本）：**"

#: ../../source/docs/common-crsf-telemetry.rst:56
#: 14e92a129b8c4009a0d3b9726e013882 66c5165303a64518a106679ab50ce01e
#: 821366c0ab4c4ee28018d8bc6e92fc93 9f79fa1908e148eb830460bc58418836
#: e915a7e9c6584f649b7bab3bc2820ec4
msgid ""
"In ArduPilot 4.7, the CRSF menu Lua API was improved to support multiple "
"concurrent menus reliably:"
msgstr "在 ArduPilot 4.7 中，CRSF 菜单 Lua API 得到改进，可可靠地支持多个并发菜单："

#: ../../source/docs/common-crsf-telemetry.rst:58
#: 1f3c301991c64477899721ccc191d24c 2c2f9fe440b848cd84369564cd67f40a
#: 75217f23080d4892a5e876eea589b070 a4dcd976b78d4e67a790f16281fa261b
#: cdbc0ccead29468182799f660204bdbf
msgid ""
"New ``crsf:peek_menu_event()`` method allows scripts to inspect pending "
"events without consuming them, so each script can check whether an event "
"belongs to its menu before processing it."
msgstr ""
"新增 ``crsf:peek_menu_event()`` "
"方法，允许脚本在不消费事件的情况下查看待处理事件，因此每个脚本可以在处理事件前先检查该事件是否属于自己的菜单。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-crsf-telemetry.rst:59
#: 18b2e5bc7e25449990fde36e42eb9825 85d4c00f15d048ea8549ef83f10692fe
#: b5dfd24d003f4ee494c5e2f75c07eb5d c6c03298e9774e4494997cce132d798b
#: fb3b1355a84c4c24a2221fdc7a0d11f1
msgid ""
"New ``crsf:pop_menu_event()`` method explicitly consumes an event after a "
"script has determined it owns the event."
msgstr "新增 ``crsf:pop_menu_event()`` 方法，在脚本确认自己拥有该事件后显式消费该事件。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-crsf-telemetry.rst:60
#: 2b59c7347b96439a9015a36fae6ab1c9 6364e5625c16486faa550fb273830893
#: 8679a00f00a04dbebaddf68c3b8367df ca7bbd9e6e8a421299e3c9b8c0c6297d
#: e1c801ef0c5b4cd49319c052ee4c1d02
msgid ""
"New ``crsf:send_response()`` method for sending generic CRSF parameter "
"responses."
msgstr "新增 ``crsf:send_response()`` 方法，用于发送通用的 CRSF 参数响应。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-crsf-telemetry.rst:61
#: 41f6b9a5a8864636896f908abc36cf08 46cea686bcfd4c0dae019fd85b2a34a4
#: 54c7350bf65a43cab31a06ff444a316c a24010f94ee445f4b76d529157f7f037
#: bb8bb09096c347bc8c9ecb0422a2d8f9
msgid ""
"Thread-safe access to the menu event queues via internal semaphore "
"protection."
msgstr "通过内部信号量保护，实现对菜单事件队列的线程安全访问。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-crsf-telemetry.rst:63
#: 1b4b02394229450aa6f30dcd10630460 4b38d2a563dd42d0aece146611a5ffb4
#: 705b6b8862834cd0b4a20add281ed6f3 86526da197674a8d928c0f569553a287
#: a23af686b55b4249b150da4426f8bdc3
msgid ""
"Scripts using ``crsf_helper.lua`` automatically benefit from these "
"improvements. Scripts using the low-level CRSF API directly should be "
"updated to use the peek/pop pattern instead of the older "
"``crsf:get_menu_event()`` to avoid consuming events intended for other "
"scripts."
msgstr ""
"使用 ``crsf_helper.lua`` 的脚本自动受益于这些改进。直接使用底层 CRSF API 的脚本应更新为使用 peek/pop "
"模式，替代旧的 ``crsf:get_menu_event()``，以避免消费掉本属于其他脚本的事件。"
